  "id": "recipe-zimage-turbo.t2i-upscale2x",
  "revision": 2,
  "title": "Z-Image Turbo: text to image, upscaled 2x",
  "description": "Text to image with Z-Image Turbo at half the task's width and height, then a 4x upscale model (RealESRGAN x4plus) and a lanczos downscale by 0.5, so the saved image has the task's size at twice the generated resolution. The Z-Image part is recipe-zimage-turbo.t2i: 10 steps at CFG 1.0, the zeroed positive as negative. The generated sides are multiples of 16, so the task's must be multiples of 32; the contract check refuses a task size off it.",
  "kind": "image",
  "operations": [
    "text_to_image"
  ],
